  "description": "In-gwang, who was spreading an unidentified virus in the plaza where a large-scale rally was held, was caught by news team Hye-na, Won-sik, and security guard Hyung-joo. The virus has already spread helplessly. In-gwang is the only hope to stop this disaster, but the group hates In-gwang, and In-gwang hates humans.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=783022), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6657989)",
